#. translators: Example patterns for protected paths with ** syntax
msgid "Examples:\n2024/03/logo-2019.png\n2023/*/header-*.jpg\n2024/**/receipts/*.pdf\nhttps://example.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/logo.png"
msgstr ""

msgid "Use * wildcards for glob patterns: * matches within one directory segment, ** matches across segments. Paths are relative to the uploads directory. Derivatives (thumbnails, WebP) are automatically protected when the original is protected."
msgstr ""

